            <ArticleTitle>Educating our children: the pilot school program.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>173-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article describes a back injury prevention program for children between the ages of 8 and 11. The aims of this program are: (1) to teach awareness, (2) to start good habits early and change existing bad habits, and (3) to encourage regular stretching and strengthening exercises.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
